From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thororen <78185467+thororen1234@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:37:21 -0400
Subject: build: support a macOS 10.13 deployment target

Chromium only builds for its own minimum macOS version. Fix the code that
fails to build when targeting macOS 10.13, mostly by checking the
availability of APIs added in later versions at runtime.

On x64, PAGE_SIZE is a signed constant rather than vm_page_size when
targeting macOS versions older than 11, so check it with a static assert
as is already done for iOS on x86, and widen it before multiplying by
32-bit page counts so system memory info doesn't wrap above 4 GB.

kIOMainPortDefault only exists from macOS 12. Pass MACH_PORT_NULL, which
it is defined as and which IOKit has always accepted for the default
port.

Before macOS 10.15, launch applications with the NSWorkspace launch
options API that NSWorkspaceOpenConfiguration replaced, and set a child
process's working directory with pthread_chdir_np() as on iOS instead of
posix_spawn_file_actions_addchdir_np(). CPU security mitigations for
child processes are only requested on macOS 11 and later, and stack
frames are decoded by hand before pthread_stack_frame_decode_np() exists
in macOS 10.14. The SVG pasteboard type uses its identifier string, as
UTTypeSVG needs macOS 11.

Unexportable keys live in the data protection keychain, so they are only
offered on macOS 10.15 and later. Web MIDI only uses the MIDIEventList
APIs on macOS 11 and later. Native colors fall back to the Aqua
appearance before dark mode exists in macOS 10.14, and set the current
appearance around color lookups before
performAsCurrentDrawingAppearance: exists in macOS 11. Transfer functions
and HDR color space names that newer releases added are only used where
they exist. MTLSharedEventFence only holds events created by newer Metal
APIs, so it doesn't need its own checks.

UTType from UniformTypeIdentifiers needs macOS 11. base/mac/uttype_compat
wraps the type lookups that callers need, using UTType where it exists
and the Launch Services UTType functions it replaced before that, and the
Services menu and MIME type code compare type identifiers instead. Other
macOS 10.14 through 13 APIs are checked at runtime with the fallback that
Chromium used before dropping those releases where one exists, such as
SCNetworkReachability, CVBufferGetAttachment(), CGDisplayModeGetRefreshRate()
and the NSWorkspace URL opening API. Permission checks that didn't exist
on older releases report access as granted.

Features that need a newer release are turned off there instead:
ScreenCaptureKit audio capture before macOS 13, the GameController based
gamepad fetcher before macOS 11, the HDR copier, Bluetooth permission,
text-to-speech and photo capture before macOS 10.15 or 10.14. Files only
reached behind those checks, or behind existing ScreenCaptureKit and
CoreML ones, build without the unguarded availability warning.

kern.osproductversion only exists from macOS 10.13.4, so derive the macOS
version from the Darwin version before that. setsockopt(IP_DONTFRAG) is
only used on macOS 11 and later again.

This patch is needed for macOS 10.13 support and is not suitable for
upstreaming.

